{
    "title": "Meta Horizon",
    "description": "Meet, play, and move through worlds with your friends in Meta Horizon. Discover games, sports, and music. You can also pair the app with your Meta Quest headset. In Meta Horizon, you\u2019ll never run out of things to do. \r\n\r\nSet up a Meta Quest \r\n- Manage your profile and easily set up your device \r\n- Customize settings for everyone in your family, with permissions for children (10-12) and teens (13+)\r\n- Cast your Meta Quest experience to your phone or a nearby compatible screen\r\n\r\nSo. Many. Experiences.\r\n- Explore 500+ games, apps and experiences from the Store\r\n- Jump into multiplayer games, live concerts, comedy shows and more together. \r\n- Keep playing with your friends directly on your phone, no matter where they are or what device they're using\r\n\r\nYour look, your way \r\n- Customize your avatar for a unique look or celebrate your fandom with colors from your favorite team\r\n- Complete quests to unlock exclusive avatar styles, items and emotes\r\n\r\nLearn how we're working to help keep our communities safe across Meta technologies at the Meta Quest Safety Center: https://www.meta.com/quest/safety-center/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Meet, play, and move through worlds with your friends in Meta Horizon. Discover games, sports, and music. You can also pair the app with your Meta Quest headset. In Meta Horizon, you\u2019ll never run out of things to do. <br><br>Set up a Meta Quest <br>- Manage your profile and easily set up your device <br>- Customize settings for everyone in your family, with permissions for children (10-12) and teens (13+)<br>- Cast your Meta Quest experience to your phone or a nearby compatible screen<br><br>So. Many. Experiences.<br>- Explore 500+ games, apps and experiences from the Store<br>- Jump into multiplayer games, live concerts, comedy shows and more together. <br>- Keep playing with your friends directly on your phone, no matter where they are or what device they&#39;re using<br><br>Your look, your way <br>- Customize your avatar for a unique look or celebrate your fandom with colors from your favorite team<br>- Complete quests to unlock exclusive avatar styles, items and emotes<br><br>Learn how we&#39;re working to help keep our communities safe across Meta technologies at the Meta Quest Safety Center: https://www.meta.com/quest/safety-center/",
